Music module
-------------
The music widget's playback engine (audio stream decoding, HTTP range streaming,
ID3 skipping, NetEase Cloud Music API calls and LRC lyric parsing) is derived from
**Net Music Mod / 网络音乐机** by TartaricAcid and contributors
(https://github.com/TartaricAcid/NetMusic), which is published under the MIT License.
Files derived from it live in
src/main/java/top/hmjmfabc/projector/client/music/ and in the music branch of
client/gui/MusicPickerScreen.java.

Supported audio formats are MP3 / FLAC / WAV. **AAC/M4A is intentionally not supported**:
its decoder (javasound-aac) declares the same packages as the JAAD classes bundled inside
JCodec, and two jar-in-jar libraries exporting the same JPMS package make ModLauncher fail
during startup (java.lang.module.ResolutionException). The music module works without it.

Only the music module references that project: every other part of this mod
(planes, widgets, rendering, media transfer, games, sequences, fonts) was written
independently and shares no code with it.

